<<~ ahu slot=`#/domain-sweep-2026-11-01-read-only`>>

! Domain sweep (Domain-Sweeper: Lares (Tasked Spirit)) 2026-11-01. READ-ONLY.

Counts = `.mem` carriers on this branch (feature/green-jello-dinosaur-5). Intent lines quote canon; leans are marked LEAN.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/1-domain-table`>>

!! 1. Domain table

| domain | intent (source) | owner | fences | carriers |h
| bags/lares: `api/` | live house canon, the permanent API (`ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/...`; wiki-layer-ontology "stable... permanent API") | house (operator + crew) | boot seed `.claude/noosphere-boot` projections; submission-guarded carriers | 183 |
| bags/lares: `docs/` (pono 101, history 18, swarm-harvest 55, research 17, art-sigils, voices, graph...) | design-and-feedback loop + records: designs, roads, harvest rooms. `docs/pono` = promotion antechamber to `api/pono` (otakiage #/promotion boundary); `history` = "old designs to harvest... then retire/burn" (otakiage THE RULING) | house | `lares-history` is record, never canon ("stays untouched", recipe-layer-model) | 250 |
| bags/lares: `ref/` `library/` `cli/` | RFC mirrors and library texts (discordia, kumulipo, mark-twain); reference, third-party voice | house, third-party text | quoted text keeps its own wording | 13 / 3 / 3 |
| bags/lares: `wsl2/` | host runbooks and incident record | house | none | 4 |
| bags/lararium | the node's own canon: `api` 32, `mesh` 68, `tw5` 54, `docs` 51, `node` 13, `browser` 3, `keyhive` 3, `lists` 1. Live canon = api/mesh/browser (evergreen-boundary `isCanonFile`) | house | none beyond the above | 226 |
| bags/crossroads | the public oracle plane / recipe library bag (wiki-recipe.ts `CROSSROADS_BAG`); `cap-tier=public` | house, public infra | public-facing register (feedback_outward_facing_register) | 6 |
| bags/elyncia | the Elyncia fiction setting for the operator's RPG crowds: books 4, campaign 5, characters 10, concepts 8, factions 4, nexuses 11. In-world narration "keeps its own voice" (project_rpg_materials_to_main) | operator-only fiction canon (LEAN: no canon line says "operator-only" in so many words; the rpg-materials ruling and the elyncia/ bag meta imply it) | NEVER L-Prime/Evergreen the in-world prose (rpg ruling); CLAUDE.md in this checkout carries no never-edit list (searched CLAUDE.md, AGENTS.md, .claude) &#45;- the fence stands in memory only | 43 |
| bags/elyncia-referee | the referee tier: NPC private truths, sealed hooks; `cap-tier=contract`; every meme `kapu` or `data` (its meta.mem) | operator (referee's hands) | never federates player-facing | 12 |
| bags/sdm | Synthetic Dream Machine game system: components, modules, mount-points, epic, procedures, projections, templates, witness, docs (Powers composition model, Arcana). Tags are system-own (`components/domain/...`, `mount-points/trait`) | operator + SDM design | Luka Rejec's permitted text (Golden Age); third-party rights | 46 |
| bags/ftls, bags/wtf | DO NOT EXIST. FTLS and WTF stand only as root dirs `ftls/` (11 files), `wtf/` (10), plus `elyncia/` (87), `sdm/` (68), `_osr/` (63): markdown chapters preserved AS IS | operator | rpg ruling 2026-10-10: no .mem conversion, no bags, third-party rights checked, Caverns chapter held back | 0 .mem |
| wiki `daemon` | "HOLDS THE WORKING-MEMORY STAGE": the surface an operator and an agent share, "belonging to no other composed knowledge domain" (wiki-layer-ontology #/the-daemon-wiki, ruling 2026-09-02; "carries working memory alone", 2026-10-20) | operator + agent jointly | must land on disk (`wikis/daemon/`); `bags/daemon` mirrorless | 0 in bags |
| wikis `lares`, `lararium` | system wikis (genesis-doc.ts `systemRecipe`): lares = oracle floor + live lararium + own canon; lararium = its own canon. Mirror `bags/lares`, `bags/lararium` | the Nexus's Kahu cabal writes them live | oracle floor is read-only, CID-frozen | the bags above |
| `wikis/` tree | ABSENT on this branch (`ls wikis` fails); `.gitignore` says named wikis are checked in, `wikis/scratch/` ignored. Any wiki beyond lares/lararium/daemon is user-minted (wiki-mint-handlers), so no elyncia/sdm/art wiki is registered in genesis | - | - | 0 |

Registry fact: recipes bind `wikis/{slug}/{temp,draft,personal,working}` over `bags/{slug}` canon over library bags over the oracle floor (wiki-recipe.ts). So a domain = a bag (what rests) plus the wiki that composes it. A "domain" with no bag and no genesis recipe (art, RPG chapters) has no registry row today.

Nowhere is there a concept-art wiki or a concept-art bag. "Concept art" appears in 5 carriers: bags/elyncia `lady-aki-concept-art.mem`, `lady-aki-poster-prompt.mem`, `session-0-1-render-research.mem`, `high-delos-cabaret.mem`, and bags/lares `docs/art-sigils/*` + `api/art-sigils/spec.mem` (MidJourney sigils). Art lives inside the Elyncia bag as character-package carriers (rating `ano`).

